==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ortь}}. Related to {{m|cu|реть|t=quarrel, competition}}.

Cognates include {{cog|sa|ऋति|t=assault}}, {{cog|sa|ऋतीयते|t=to quarrel, to hate}}, {{cog|sa|समरण|t=war, strife}}, {{cog|grc|ἔρῐς|t=strife, quarrel}} and {{cog|gem-pro|*ernustuz}} (see there for further descendants)

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-рать.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|atʲ|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+||f|adj=ра́тный}}

# {{lb|ru|archaic|or|folk poetic}} [[army]], [[host]], [[array]]
